WEBVTT

00:13:28.010 --> 00:13:31.286
You can chase your dreams
at any age; you're never too old.

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:36.389
Sixty-four; a thing no one,
at any age, any gender, could ever do

00:13:36.413 --> 00:13:37.569
has done it.

00:13:37.593 --> 00:13:39.132
And there's no doubt in my mind

00:13:39.156 --> 00:13:41.824
that I am at the prime of my life today.

00:13:41.848 --> 00:13:44.652
(Applause)

00:13:44.676 --> 00:13:45.924
Yeah.

00:13:45.948 --> 00:13:50.234
(Applause)

00:13:50.258 --> 00:13:51.434
Thank you.

00:13:52.081 --> 00:13:54.224
And the third thing
I said on that beach was,

00:13:54.248 --> 00:13:56.900
it looks like the most solitary
endeavor in the world,

00:13:56.924 --> 00:13:59.027
and in many ways, of course, it is.

00:13:59.051 --> 00:14:02.700
And in other ways,
and the most important ways,